{"id":"90240dba1c289fdf","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Lexicographic Tree Order","display":"df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order — ZFC Tree10 Lexicographic Tree Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order — ZFC Tree10 Lexicographic Tree Order","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order — ZFC Tree10 Lexicographic Tree Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (alphabet set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_A\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(R_A\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span> (linear order on the alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (finite-sequence tree carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (lexicographic-relation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{\\upharpoonright}\">\\({\\upharpoonright}\\)</span> (function restriction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (linear-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LexicographicTreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LexicographicTreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}lexicographic\\text{-}tree\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LexicographicTreeOrder}_S(L,T,A,R_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(A,R_A)\n\\land\nT\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\n\\land\nL=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\n\\land\ns=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall j\\in k\\;(s(j)=t(j))\n\\land\n\\langle s(k),t(k)\\rangle\\in R_A\n\\land\ns(k)\\neq t(k)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}lexicographic\\text{-}tree\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LexicographicTreeOrder}_S(L,T,A,R_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(A,R_A)\n\\land\nT\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\n\\land\nL=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\n\\land\ns=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall j\\in k\\;(s(j)=t(j))\n\\land\n\\langle s(k),t(k)\\rangle\\in R_A\n\\land\ns(k)\\neq t(k)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The alphabet and its order are now arguments, and lexicographic comparison is defined by the prefix case or the first differing coordinate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)$ (finite-sequence predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"${\\upharpoonright}$ (function restriction, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ (linear-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R_A\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)","display":false},{"tex":"{\\upharpoonright}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LexicographicTreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}lexicographic\\text{-}tree\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LexicographicTreeOrder}_S(L,T,A,R_A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(A,R_A)\n\\land\nT\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\n\\land\nL=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\\\\n&\\qquad\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\n\\land\ns=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall j\\in k\\;(s(j)=t(j))\n\\land\n\\langle s(k),t(k)\\rangle\\in R_A\n\\land\ns(k)\\neq t(k)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1932,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3768","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-lexicographic-tree-order]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b40aa6d4a7d8288a","f4bf86f66c1444da","36d7463d215be751"]}